1.Database Setup
Start your MySQL server (make sure it is running on localhost:3306).

2.Create the database
Open a MySQL client (e.g., phpMyAdmin, MySQL Workbench, or command line) and run:

CREATE DATABASE parkinglot_db;

3.Import the provided SQL dump
The file parkinglot_db.sql contains all table structures and initial data (5 floors with default spots).


Compilation & Execution

1.Using the provided batch file (Windows)
Simply double‑click run.bat or run it from the command prompt:

bash
run.bat

The script will:

    -Compile all Java files listed in sources.txt

    -Place compiled classes into the bin/ folder

    -Launch the GUI (main.java.view.MainGUI)